 Answer no if any has a shorter TTL, no retention, or broad read access. Answer unknown if storage is configured outside this repo.\n\n**Reviewer's evidence:** infra/terraform/main.tf:144 — \"years = 7\"\n\n**Reviewer's note:** Audit objects are locked for 7 years. Retention for manifests and prompt links, and role-based read access to the audit bucket, are not set in this repo.\n\n`infra/terraform/main.tf` lines 132–156 (cited lines marked >):\n```\n 132  \n 133  # Audit: Firehose to an S3 bucket with object lock in compliance mode (7 years, HIPAA retention).\n 134  resource \"aws_s3_bucket\" \"audit\" {\n 135    bucket              = \"clinic-agent-audit-${data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id}\"\n 136    object_lock_enabled = true\n 137  }\n 138  \n 139  resource \"aws_s3_bucket_object_lock_configuration\" \"audit\" {\n 140    bucket = aws_s3_bucket.audit.id\n 141    rule {\n 142      default_retention {\n 143        mode  = \"COMPLIANCE\"\n 144>       years = 7\n 145      }\n 146    }\n 147  }\n 148  \n 149  resource \"aws_kinesis_firehose_delivery_stream\" \"audit\" {\n 150    name        = \"clinic-agent-audit\"\n 151    destination = \"extended_s3\"\n 152    extended_s3_configuration {\n 153      role_arn            = aws_iam_role.firehose.arn\n 154      bucket_arn          = aws_s3_bucket.audit.arn\n 155      prefix              = \"audit/dt=!{timestamp:yyyy-MM-dd}/\"\n 156      error_output_prefix = \"audit-errors/!{firehose:error-output-type}/\"\n```\n\n## Your answer\n\nWrite this JSON to C08.verdict.json in this folder (or put it in verdicts.json under \"C08\"):\n```json\n{\"verdict\": \"upheld | failed | unclear\",\n \"checks\": [{\"id\": \"C08.1\", \"result\": \"holds | fails | unclear\", \"evidence\": \"path:line\", \"quote\": \"exact code\", \"note\": \"why\"}],\n \"note\": \"one sentence\"}\n```\nVerdict is **failed** if any check fails, **unclear** if none fails but any is unclear, otherwise **upheld**. A failed check needs the quoted line that makes it false: `evidence` is path:line, and `quote` is the exact text of that line. To cite two places, list both refs in `evidence` (`a.py:12, b.yaml:40`) and put each line's text on its own line in `quote`. If the check fails, add `\"violates\": [\"words copied exactly from the requirement\"]`.\nagent\nagent/infra\nagent/infra/terraform\nagent/infra/terraform/main.tf\nagent/infra/terraform/github.tf\nagent/infra/terraform/iam.tf\nagent/test\nagent/test/controls.test.ts\nagent/test/budget.test.ts\nagent/config\nagent/config/tools.allowlist.yaml\nagent/config/policy.yaml\nagent/config/budgets.yaml\nagent/Dockerfile\nagent/k8s\nagent/k8s/deployment.yaml\nagent/release\nagent/release/manifest.json\nagent/README.md\nagent/package.json\nagent/.github\nagent/.github/CODEOWNERS\nagent/.github/workflows\nagent/.github/workflows/deploy.yml\nagent/.github/workflows/ci.yml\nagent/prompts\nagent/prompts/intent-classifier.txt\nagent/prompts/system.md\nagent/tsconfig.json\nagent/src\nagent/src/tools\nagent/src/tools/executor.ts\nagent/src/tools/metadata-scan.ts\nagent/src/tools/registry.ts\nagent/src/tools/approvals.ts\nagent/src/workflows\nagent/src/workflows/eligibility-check.ts\nagent/src/agent\nagent/src/agent/identity.ts\nagent/src/agent/context-size.ts\nagent/src/agent/loop.ts\nagent/src/agent/budget.ts\nagent/src/agent/classifier.ts\nagent/src/integrations\nagent/src/integrations/sms.ts\nagent/src/integrations/ehr-mcp.ts\nagent/src/integrations/payments.ts\nagent/src/integrations/eligibility-a2a.ts\nagent/src/audit\nagent/src/audit/recorder.ts\nagent/src/workers\nagent/src/workers/reminders.ts\nagent/src/config.ts\nagent/src/server.ts\nagent/src/routes\nagent/src/routes/webchat.ts\nagent/src/routes/sms-webhook.ts\nagent/src/control\nagent/src/control/kill-switch.ts","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
